# Exponential Desktop's factory ground (#EDE-42, #EDE-44): the IDE look's frame. A background layer
# surface over the whole output: the IDE's ground (flat here: a gradient would seam against the
# sidebar's and the taskbar's flat fill), and the grey rounded panel the focused window sits on
# (radius 12, a hairline border, the IDE's panel fill), inset by the taskbar (48) plus the 10 px panel
# margin the compositor keeps windows inside ([windows] panel_margin). No rail on the left (#EDE-238:
# the start menu's tree is the navigation). The numbers are packages/uicore/fixtures/shell-layout.json.
surface("ground", extensions={ede: {layer: "background", anchor: ["top", "bottom", "left", "right"], exclusiveZone: -1}})
root = Box(style={display: "flex", flexDirection: "row", width: "100%", height: "100%", backgroundColor: "$color.background"}, children=[column])
column = Box(style={display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", flexGrow: 1, minWidth: 0, paddingTop: 10, paddingRight: 10, paddingLeft: 10, paddingBottom: 58}, children=[panel])
panel = Box(style={flexGrow: 1, borderRadius: "$radius.lg", borderWidth: 1, borderColor: "$color.border", backgroundColor: "$color.muted"})
